@api = http://localhost:5267

### 1. Register
POST {{api}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@example.com", "displayName": "Alice", "headline": "Optimizely dev", "password": "Passw0rd!123" }

### 2. Login: copies the token into {{token}} for the requests below
# @name login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 3. Who am I?
GET {{api}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Without a token: expect 401
GET {{api}}/api/users/me

### 5. My suggestions (rate limited per logged-in user)
GET {{api}}/api/me/suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Send a connection request (replace with another user's id)
POST {{api}}/api/connections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "addresseeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000" }
